<title>BELGIUM: KREDIETBANK LOWERS MORTGAGE RATES.</title>
<headline>KREDIETBANK LOWERS MORTGAGE RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Kredietbank said it was lowering its base mortgage rates as follows, effective immediately.</p>
<p>    MATURITY			   NEW RATE	OLD RATE</p>
<p>    three year revisable	   6.00 pct	6.10 pct</p>
<p>    five year revisable	    6.75 pct	7.05 pct</p>
<p>    10-year fixed		    7.70 pct	8.00 pct</p>
<p>    20-year fixed		    8.40 pct	8.70 pct</p>
<p>    &quot;one way&quot; rate		   8.80 pct	9.10 pct</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
